1
00:00:00,483 --> 00:00:01,853
We're not fighting;
we're just...

2
00:00:01,851 --> 00:00:03,151
(Leonard:)having a conversation.

3
00:00:03,153 --> 00:00:05,083
(Wil:)All right.

4
00:00:05,088 --> 00:00:07,988
(Wil:)We're listening
to a really fun conversation

5
00:00:07,991 --> 00:00:11,091
(Wil:)between my costar
from Serial Ape-ist 2

6
00:00:11,094 --> 00:00:12,664
and her fiancé,
who doesn't believe

7
00:00:12,662 --> 00:00:15,092
(Wil:)women should have dreams.

8
00:00:17,132 --> 00:00:20,002
(Leonard:)Give me back that juice.

9
00:00:21,136 --> 00:00:22,936
(Penny:)What is the harm
if I audition?

10
00:00:22,939 --> 00:00:24,369
(Leonard:)Well, what if you get it?

11
00:00:24,374 --> 00:00:26,544
(Penny:)I don't know, I make a movie,

12
00:00:26,543 --> 00:00:28,043
(Penny:)become rich and famous,

13
00:00:28,044 --> 00:00:29,444
(Penny:)win an Oscar, a Golden Globe

14
00:00:29,446 --> 00:00:31,376
(Penny:)and live an incredibly
wonderful life.

15
00:00:31,381 --> 00:00:34,081
(Leonard:)From a Kevin Smith movie?

16
00:00:35,184 --> 00:00:37,554
KEVIN:
Oh, I'm hanging up now.

17
00:00:37,554 --> 00:00:38,954
(Wil:)Don't you listen
to him, buddy.

18
00:00:38,955 --> 00:00:40,125
(Wil:)You're awesome.

19
00:00:40,123 --> 00:00:42,053
(Wil:)You're one of the greatest
directors of our time.

20
00:00:42,058 --> 00:00:44,758
(Caller:)I don't have
a part for you, Wheaton.

21
00:00:45,694 --> 00:00:47,694
(Wil:)And that was Kevin Smith.

22
00:00:47,697 --> 00:00:50,067
(Wil:)Thanks a lot.

23
00:00:50,066 --> 00:00:51,736
(Leonard:)I'm just trying to protect you.

24
00:00:51,735 --> 00:00:54,065
(Leonard:)How many times did I see you
get your heart broken

25
00:00:54,070 --> 00:00:55,840
(Leonard:)trying to make it
as an actress?

26
00:00:55,839 --> 00:00:57,409
(Penny:)Okay, instead of protecting me,
why don't you try

27
00:00:57,407 --> 00:00:59,037
(Penny:)being excited when
something good happens?

